BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_RulesAreListed:
	.string "上面列出了探索式对战的规则。$"

BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading:
	.string "您想读哪个标题？$"

BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ExplainMonRules:
	.string "金字塔被征服之后，\n在其中出现的野生宝可梦\l会换成别的种类。\p去探索、去观察，弄清楚\n会遇到哪些野生宝可梦吧。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ExplainTrainerRules:
	.string "金字塔里有训练家\n在等着您。\p每一层最多有\n八位训练家。\p击败训练家后，您会得到\n对冒险有用的提示。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ExplainMazeRules:
	.string "每次进入金字塔，迷宫\n都会重新排列。\p迷宫里光线昏暗，\n必须小心前进。\p每当您击败野生宝可梦\n或训练家，光线就会变亮。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

BattleFrontier_BattlePyramidLobby_Text_ExplainBagRules:
	.string "在金字塔里，对战背包\n就是您的背包。\p对战背包有两个——\n经典和混沌的冒险\l各用一个。\p每个最多能装十种道具，\n每种99个。\p如果探索失败，对战背包里\n的东西会全部失去。$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
`

script PyramidLobbyBPVendor {
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox("欢迎光临！")
	bpmart(PyramidBPVendor)
	msgbox("谢谢惠顾！")
	release
	end
}

mart PyramidBPVendor {
	ITEM_FLAME_ORB
	ITEM_TOXIC_ORB
	ITEM_LIFE_ORB
	ITEM_FOCUS_SASH
	ITEM_POWER_HERB
	ITEM_WHITE_HERB
	ITEM_BLACK_SLUDGE
	ITEM_ASSAULT_VEST
	ITEM_LOADED_DICE
	ITEM_ROCKY_HELMET
}
